hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"15459","Jarir narrated to us, from Mansur, from Mujahid, from Abu al-Hakam, or al-Hakam ibn Sufyan al-Thaqafi, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate, then perform wudu and sprinkle his private part."
"15460","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, he said: Sharik said: I asked the family of al-Hakam ibn Sufyan, and they mentioned that he did not meet the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"15461","Abd Allah narrated to us, he said: I found in the book of my father in his handwriting: Yala ibn Ubayd narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us, from Mansur, from Mujahid, from a man of Thaqif, he is al-Hakam ibn Sufyan or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate, then, meaning, sprinkle his private part."
